ry fragrances &#8226; Long-lasting &#8226; Made in Europe &#8226; IFRA Approved</p></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container grid2\"><div class=\"img-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp22_img_03.jpg?v=1785025546\" width=\"1536\" height=\"864\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Getting ready\"></div><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">The finishing touch</p><h2>Most perfumes smell nice.<br>Few become unforgettable.</h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"color:white;font-weight:600\">We know which ones do.</p><p class=\"lead\">The right fragrance is not just another beauty product.</p><p class=\"lead\">It is the finishing touch that completes the look and makes your presence known with every step you take.</p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section problem\"><div class=\"container center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Why some get noticed</p><h2>Why do some fragrances get compliments...</h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin:16px auto 0\">...while others disappear before you&#8217;re out the door?</p><div class=\"cards3\"><div class=\"card\"><h3>Too little fragrance oil</h3><p>Lighter formulas can contain as little as 5&#8211;15% fragrance concentration.</p><p>That can mean weaker projection and a scent that fades before the night has really started.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Too much fragrance oil</h3><p>Some intense parfums reach 40% fragrance concentration or more.</p><p>Without the right balance, that richness can feel dense, heavy, and overpowering instead of drawing people closer.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Cheaper ingredients</h3><p>Low-quality or poorly tolerated ingredients can irritate the skin, trigger redness or rashes, and leave some people with headaches.</p></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section solution\"><div class=\"container\"><div style=\"max-width:700px\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The TryScent difference</p><h2>Designed to draw them closer.</h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"color:#eadce2\">TryScent fragrances are made by the same fragrance experts behind some of the world&#8217;s best-known perfumes.</p><p class=\"lead\" style=\"color:#eadce2\">That same quality and longevity you expect from the big brands?</p><p class=\"accent\">We&#8217;ve got it.</p><p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:30px\">Premium, inside and out</p></div><div class=\"quality\"><div class=\"card\"><h3>21%+ Perfume Oil</h3><p>Built at true perfume strength for lasting performance and noticeable projection.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Made in Europe</h3><p>Crafted to premium European manufacturing standards.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>IFRA Approved</h3><p>Meets the world&#8217;s leading fragrance safety standards.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Clean Label</h3><p>No phthalates. No parabens. Fully transparent ingredients that are kinder to your skin.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Vegan &amp; Cruelty-Free</h3><p>Made without animal-derived ingredients or animal testing.</p></div></div></div></section>\n</div>",
