      "name": "Page content",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"ts-lp22\"><section class=\"section proof\"><div class=\"container\"><div style=\"max-width:740px\"><p class=\"lead\" style=\"color:#eadce2\">These are the fragrances women kept coming back to when they wanted more compliments, more chemistry, and dates that ended a little later than planned.</p><p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:30px\">Don&#8217;t take our word for it</p><h2>Why customers loved these fragrances</h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"color:#eadce2\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.9/5</p><p class=\"lead\" style=\"color:#eadce2\">Women looking for the same thing consistently loved these fragrances.</p></div><div class=\"reviews\"><div class=\"review\"><p>&#8220;I often get asked what perfume I&#8217;m wearing. That&#8217;s how amazing it is!&#8221;</p><small>Karolina B., verified customer</small></div><div class=\"review\"><p>&#8220;The scent lasts much longer than I expected. I&#8217;ve already received several compliments while wearing them.&#8221;</p><small>Alina M., verified customer</small></div><div class=\"review\"><p>&#8220;Two gorgeous scents that honestly impressed me with how elegant they smell.&#8221;</p><small>Yana V., verified customer</small></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section trust2\"><div class=\"container grid2\"><div class=\"img-card\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp22_img_04.jpg?v=1785025546\" width=\"1229\" height=\"1536\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Perfume application\"></div><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">What you are really paying for</p><h2>Every TryScent fragrance is inspired by some of the world&#8217;s most iconic luxury perfumes.</h2><p class=\"lead\">Made by the same fragrance experts behind some of the world&#8217;s best-known perfumes.</p><p class=\"lead\">Built with the quality and performance people expect from premium fragrance.</p><p class=\"lead\" style=\"color:white;font-weight:600\">The difference is what you are not paying for.</p><div class=\"paylist\"><div>Designer branding.</div><div>Celebrity campaigns.</div><div>Luxury packaging.</div><div>Retail markups.</div></div><p class=\"lead\">So paying less does not mean getting less.</p><p class=\"accent\">You pay for the scent.<br>Not the logo on the bottle.</p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section offer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"offerbox\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Your next favourite is waiting</p><h2>The one they can&#8217;t get enough of.</h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin:16px auto 0\">You&#8217;ve seen what works. Now make it yours.</p><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin:14px auto 0\">Order today and we&#8217;ll include a free full-sized Mystery Fragrance to help you discover another favourite.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#find\">Find The One</a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Questions, answered</p><h2>FAQ</h2><details><summary>How long do they last?</summary><p>Our fragrances contain 21%+ fragrance oil, delivering the long-lasting performance people expect from premium perfumes.</p></details><details><summary>Why are they so much cheaper?</summary><p>You are paying for the fragrance, not designer branding, celebrity campaigns, luxury packaging, or retail markups.</p></details><details><summary>Are they safe to wear?</summary><p>Yes. Our fragrances are Made in Europe, IFRA approved, and feature a Clean Label formula with no phthalates or parabens. Every ingredient is fully listed.</p></details><details><summary>What if I do not like my fragrance?</summary><p>You are covered by our 60-day money-back guarantee, so you can try it with confidence.</p></details><details><summary>Which fragrance should I choose?</summary><p>Start with the recommendations on this page. They are based on thousands of customer experiences from people looking for attraction, confidence, and unforgettable first impressions.</p></details></div></section>\n<section class=\"section subscribe\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"subbox\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Signature Membership</p><h2>You would not wear the same outfit everywhere.</h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"color:white\">Why wear the same fragrance?</p><div class=\"benefits\"><div>Personal fragrance recommendations</div><div>Member-only releases and offers</div><div>Seasonal favourites chosen for you</div><div>Exclusive member pricing</div><div>2 bottles per month</div></div><div class=\"member\"><div class=\"price\">149 kr/month</div><p>Limited monthly access</p><p><strong style=\"color:white\">01 Register with our fragrance concierge</strong><br>We will let you know when a Signature Membership becomes available.</p><p><strong style=\"color:white\">02 If you secure a place</strong><br>You will receive your first Signature recommendation and member welcome gift.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#lp22-optin\">Apply for Signature Membership</a></div><div id=\"lp22-optin\"><form class=\"form\" method=\"post\" action=\"/contact#lp22-optin\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_type\" value=\"customer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"utf8\" value=\"&#x2713;\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"return_to\" value=\"\" class=\"lp22-return-to\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"contact[tags]\" value=\"newsletter,LP35\"><input type=\"email\" name=\"contact[email]\" required autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Join The List</button></form><p class=\"lp22-optin-ok\" hidden style=\"margin-top:14px;color:#e8aec3;font-weight:600\">Thank you! You&#8217;re on the list.</p></div></div></div></section>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var SECTIONS='cart-drawer,cart-icon-bubble';\n  function drawerEl(){return document.querySelector('cart-drawer');}\n  function closeDrawer(d){\n    if(typeof d.close==='function'){d.close();}\n    else{d.classList.remove('active');document.body.classList.remove('overflow-hidden');}\n  }\n  function applySections(sec){\n    var d=drawerEl();\n    if(!d)return false;\n    if(typeof d.renderContents==='function'){\n      try{d.renderContents({sections:sec});return true;}catch(err){}\n    }\n    if(!sec||!sec['cart-drawer'])return false;\n    var t=document.createElement('div');t.innerHTML=sec['cart-drawer'];\n    var inner=t.querySelector('cart-drawer');\n    if(!inner)return false;\n    d.innerHTML=inner.innerHTML;\n    d.className=inner.className;\n    var ov=d.querySelector('#CartDrawer-Overlay');\n    if(ov)ov.addEventListener('click',function(){closeDrawer(d);});\n    if(typeof d.open==='function'){d.open();}\n    else{d.classList.add('animate','active');document.body.classList.add('overflow-hidden');}\n    return true;\n  }\n  function fetchAndOpen(){\n    fetch('/?sections='+SECTIONS)\n      .then(function(r){return r.json()})\n      .then(function(sec){if(!applySections(sec))window.location.href='/cart';})\n      .catch(function(){window.location.href='/cart';});\n  }\n  document.addEventListener('click',function(e){\n    var cartBtn=e.target.closest('.lp22-cart');\n    if(cartBtn){e.preventDefault();fetchAndOpen();return;}\n    var btn=e.target.closest('.lp22-atc');\n    if(!btn)return;\n    e.preventDefault();\n    var vid=btn.getAttribute('data-variant-id');\n    var orig=btn.innerHTML;\n    btn.disabled=true;btn.innerHTML='Adding...';\n    fetch('/cart/add.js',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},\n      body:JSON.stringify({items:[{id:parseInt(vid,10),quantity:1}],sections:SECTIONS,sections_url:window.location.pathname})})\n      .then(function(r){if(!r.ok)throw new Error('add failed');return r.json()})\n      .then(function(data){\n        btn.innerHTML='Added \\u2713';\n        if(!applySections(data&&data.sections))fetchAndOpen();\n        setTimeout(function(){btn.innerHTML=orig;btn.disabled=false;},1500);\n      })\n      .catch(function(){\n        btn.disabled=false;btn.innerHTML=orig;\n        window.location.href='/products/'+btn.getAttribute('data-handle');\n      });\n  });\n  var rt=document.querySelector('.lp22-return-to');\n  if(rt)rt.value=window.location.pathname+'?customer_posted=true#lp22-optin';\n  if(/[?&]customer_posted=true/.test(window.location.search)){\n    var box=document.getElementById('lp22-optin');\n    if(box){\n      var f=box.querySelector('form');if(f)f.hidden=true;\n      var ok=box.querySelector('.lp22-optin-ok');if(ok)ok.hidden=false;\n      box.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});\n    }\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</div>",
